<title>USA: McLeod to raise funds in private placement.</title>
<headline>McLeod to raise funds in private placement.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>McLeod Inc said Tuesday it plans to raise about $200 million in a private offer of senior discount notes due in 2007.</p>
<p>The company said the notes will be offered to qualified institutional buyers and institutional accredited investors.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to cover development and construction of its fiber optic network, expansion programs and for potential acquisitions, the company said.</p>
<p>McLeod provides telecommunications services.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 1/8 Tuesday afternoon at 22.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
